この辺は山で通れなそう。
Looks impassable around here because of the mountains.

910
00:38:56,436 --> 00:38:59,936
通れないのか。291号線。
Guess you can't get through. Route 291.

911
00:38:59,936 --> 00:39:01,136
ふんふんふん。
Uh-huh.

912
00:39:01,436 --> 00:39:03,636
443！
443!

913
00:39:03,636 --> 00:39:08,436
福岡から、熊本ー。
From Fukuoka to Kumamoto.

914
00:39:08,436 --> 00:39:13,436
これも結構、き...でもぐるっと。
This one is also pretty... though it loops around.

915
00:39:13,436 --> 00:39:17,236
比較的、比較的に平野よりかも今までの中では。
Compared to the others so far, it's relatively more on flat land.

916
00:39:15,936 --> 00:39:18,636
確かに。中だとね。
True, out of the ones we've seen.

917
00:39:18,636 --> 00:39:21,136
わりと市街地に辿り着いてる。
It actually reaches urban areas pretty well.

918
00:39:21,136 --> 00:39:23,136
でも100キロ以上ありますね。
Still over 100 kilometers though.

919
00:39:23,136 --> 00:39:24,636
遠い。
Far.

920
00:39:24,636 --> 00:39:27,136
231！
231!

921
