長崎！
Nagasaki!

940
00:40:20,777 --> 00:40:22,077
ふんふんふん
Uh-huh, uh-huh.

941
00:40:22,527 --> 00:40:24,877
長崎も島が多いですけど
Nagasaki also has a lot of islands, though...

942
00:40:24,977 --> 00:40:30,177
長崎の中でも結構山々して、っていうか長崎全体的に山が多い
Even within Nagasaki it's quite mountainous... or rather, Nagasaki as a whole has lots of mountains.

943
00:40:30,227 --> 00:40:31,677
山が多い。坂が多い
Lots of mountains. Lots of slopes.

944
00:40:31,777 --> 00:40:32,877
山も坂も
Mountains and slopes too.

945
00:40:32,977 --> 00:40:33,577
うん
Yeah.

946
00:40:33,677 --> 00:40:37,077
ここです。これでも地続きになってんだ、この島
Here it is. Oh, this island is actually connected by land!

947
00:40:37,127 --> 00:40:38,177
え、すごい！
Whoa, amazing!

948
00:40:38,227 --> 00:40:40,027
ね、海上区間ないから
Yeah, because there's no marine section.

949
00:40:40,077 --> 00:40:42,377
じゃあ、めっちゃ橋がかかって、それとも...
So, there must be tons of bridges, or...

950
00:40:42,427 --> 00:40:43,777
橋っぽいのじゃ
Looks like bridges!

951
00:40:43,877 --> 00:40:46,077
ねえ。長崎です
Right. That's Nagasaki.

952
00:40:46,677 --> 00:40:47,677
次いくのじゃ
Going to the next one.

953
00:40:47,777 --> 00:40:49,277
はい、114
Okay, 114!

954
00:40:49,327 --> 00:40:50,277
114！
114!

955
00:40:50,577 --> 00:40:53,177
福島ー！
Fukushima!

956
00:40:53,677 --> 00:40:55,377
これは短めかも
This one might be on the shorter side.

957
00:40:55,427 --> 00:40:56,727
ね、短めか？
Yeah, is it short?

958
00:40:57,377 --> 00:40:58,577
福島の...
In Fukushima's...

959
00:40:58,627 --> 00:40:59,377
ふんふん
Uh-huh.

960
00:40:59,427 --> 00:41:02,877
北の方の東西ですね
north side, running east to west.

961
00:41:02,927 --> 00:41:04,077
うんうんうん
Mm-hmm, mm-hmm.

962
00:41:04,127 --> 00:41:05,477
114

963
00:41:05,877 --> 00:41:08,177
はい、レア！
Okay, a Rare!

964
00:41:08,227 --> 00:41:09,177
え、短くね？
Wait, isn't it super short?

965
00:41:09,227 --> 00:41:10,377
短っ！
So short!

966
00:41:10,877 --> 00:41:11,777
なんでこれ？
Why is it like this?

967
00:41:11,827 --> 00:41:13,477
え、500メートル！？
Huh, 500 meters?!

968
00:41:13,527 --> 00:41:14,677
もし走れる...
Wait, I can run that!

969
00:41:14,727 --> 00:41:15,777
走れる！
You can run it!

970
00:41:15,877 --> 00:41:17,077
東京都...
Tokyo...

971
00:41:17,127 --> 00:41:17,877
おお、ほう
Oh, ho.

972
00:41:17,927 --> 00:41:20,377
港区から港区
from Minato Ward to Minato Ward.

973
00:41:20,477 --> 00:41:21,477
えっ？
Huh?

974
